@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/tutorial-siege-lines.puml
' purpose: there is no placed siege-line type — siege is a tank mode
' status: OUTDATED — withdrawn (invented object); product = StarChess
' covers: packages/starchess-core/src/board/siege.ts
'         apps/starchess/src/presentation/specials/arms/tankSiege.ts
' live spec: _spec/specials/index.puml
'            _spec/packages/starchess-core/scfen-wire.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' Backlog "siege lines" decoded as a drawable structure. Live: ""rookSiege""
' toggles packed vs sieged vision/mobility. A painted overlay of a line
' the engine does not store would desync the tutorial — so would inventing
' a line type to match the title.
title OUTDATED — no siege-line object;\nrookSiege is a tank mode toggle

component "siegedRooks / rookSiege" as MODE <<app>>
component "tutorial rook-siege\n+ specials tank" as BEAT <<app>>
component "**placed line type**\nengine has none" as LINE <<error>>

MODE ARROW_MAIN BEAT
LINE ARROW_ERROR MODE : do not add

note bottom of LINE
  **Do not teach the player to draw a
  line, and do not add a line store
  so the backlog title looks true.**
  Placement vs severance is not a
  StarChess verb.
end note

legend bottom
  **Do not implement this file.**
  ==
  Open ""board/siege.ts"" and the
  rook-siege lesson. Ships do not
  wait on a line type.
end legend
@enduml
